   "Drinfeld twist for quantum su(2) in the adjoint representation"
  ],
  "abstract": "We give a detailed description of the adjoint representation of Drinfeld\u2019s twist element, as well as of its coproduct, for suq(2). We also discuss, as applications, the computation of the universal R-matrix in this representation and the problem of symmetrization of identical-particle states with quantum su(2) symmetry. \u2217e-mail address: chryss@stp.dias.ie",
